<title>USA: H&amp;R Block Inc Q4 April 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block Inc Q4 April 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			    Three months ended April 30 (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					   1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenues			 $1,085,891	$921,931</p>
<p>Earnings before income taxes and</p>
<p>  minority interest		313,197	 299,163</p>
<p>Net earnings before minority</p>
<p>  interest			   195,868	 185,711</p>
<p> Minority interest		 (3,567)		 -</p>
<p> Net earnings			199,435	 185,711</p>
<p> Net earnings per share	     1.90	    1.75</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	     105,926	 105,390</p>
<p>					 Year ended April 30, (Audited)</p>
<p>					     1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues			  $1,929,663   $1,656,184</p>
<p>Earnings before income taxes and</p>
<p> minority interest		   38,556	285,294</p>
<p>Net earnings before minority</p>
<p>  interest			     23,943	177,168</p>
<p> Minority interest		 (23,812)		-</p>
<p> Net earnings			  47,755    177,168</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		0.45	 1.67</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>					  105,840    106,059</p>
<p>NOTES: Results for 1997 year include pretax charges recorded by CompuServe in the first, second and fourth quarters of $17.7 million, $7.9 million and $9.2 million, respectively.</p>
